</style></head><body><main class="card"><section><div class="logo"><img src="/Assets/logo.png" alt="Logo"></div><div class="status"><span class="dot"></span> ERROR <?php echo htmlspecialchars((string)$status); ?></div><h1>Something went spectacularly wrong.</h1><p>The server tried. You tried. Somewhere between those two events, reality filed a complaint.</p><p class="sarcastic">Please try again. Preferably after giving the internet a tiny moment to reconsider its life choices.</p><div class="buttons"><a class="btn primary" href="/">Return home</a><button class="btn secondary" id="retry">Try again</button></div><div class="footer">Error <?php echo htmlspecialchars((string)$status); ?> • We have absolutely no idea what happened. But we are looking into it.</div></section><section class="visual"><img class="mascot" id="mascot" src="/Assets/mascot.png" alt="Mascot"><div class="hint">Click the mascot. It knows nothing, but it may look concerned.</div></section></main><script>
const mascot=document.getElementById('mascot'),retry=document.getElementById('retry');retry.onclick=()=>{retry.textContent='Retrying…';setTimeout(()=>location.reload(),450)};mascot.onclick=()=>{mascot.classList.remove('wiggle');void mascot.offsetWidth;mascot.classList.add('wiggle')};
